What needs to change:

1. In class DefaultExecController.Execution (around line 273), the method still reads:
   ```
   @Override
   public <T> void subscribe(Publisher<T> publisher, Subscriber<T> subscriber) {
     control.stream(publisher, subscriber);
   }
   ```
   This must be renamed to `stream` in both signature and override annotation:
   ```
   @Override
   public <T> void stream(Publisher<T> publisher, Subscriber<T> subscriber) {
     control.stream(publisher, subscriber);
   }
   ```
   (lines 273–275)

2. Any JavaDoc or comments referring to “subscribe” on the ExecControl or Execution APIs should be updated to “stream”. For example, if there is `/** ... subscribe a publisher ... */` it must read `/** ... stream a publisher ... */`.

3. Make sure the interface `ratpack.exec.Execution` and/or `ExecControl` have their `subscribe` methods renamed to `stream`, and that all implementing classes and call sites reflect that change (including `ExecController.getControl()` if it exposes a `subscribe` method).

Because these renames have not been applied, the task is INCOMPLETE.

