326:    * It is sometimes more convenient to use {@link #promiseAll(ObservableOnSubscribe)} over this method.
327:    * <p>
328:    * <pre class="java">{@code
329:    * import ratpack.rx2.RxRatpack;
330:    * import ratpack.test.exec.ExecHarness;
